import lib/cadkernel/tessellation.dl

class:
    patterns:
        [a|] invalid sampling point
    members:
        unused as an integer

function the cad curve point of {invalid sampling point:curve} at {a 64 bit floating-point number:parameter}:
    execute:
        ignore curve
        return a cad vector2 with x parameter and y 0.0

function the cad curve tangent of {invalid sampling point:curve} at {a 64 bit floating-point number:parameter}:
    execute:
        ignore curve
        ignore parameter
        return the cad x axis

set curve to a new invalid sampling point
set points to the cad angular samples of curve with maximum angle 0.1
free points
